  "title": "GitLab CI: Use the default / stable macOS image",
  "description": "According to\n\nhttps://docs.gitlab.com/ee/ci/runners/saas/macos_saas_runner.html\n\nif we don't specify an image we'll run the current stable / Generally\nAvailable image, which is currently macos-13-xcode-14. Using the current\nGA image should be more stable since we currently use Homebrew to\ninstall our prerequisites, and it's pretty agressive about deprecating\nold macOS versions.",
